---

The `.po` and `.csv` catalogs under `po/` and `csv/` are translations of strings
extracted from the Frappe apps listed in README.md. Each catalog is offered under
the license of the app it belongs to (MIT for frappe and wiki; AGPL-3.0 for crm,
helpdesk, insights, telephony and drive; GPL-3.0 for erpnext and hrms), so it can
be merged upstream without relicensing.
